// WARNING:  Each effect has a constraint of a maximum of *FIVE* changes per *type*
// of change (so you could have 5 changes to stats *and* 5 changes to skills, but
// not 6 changes to stats)

// Start at 0, and go up to 49. The following line is an example:

{0}{st +6, be -6, in -6, prowling -3, age +20}	// up strength a lot at the cost of beauty, intelligence and prowling. Adjust age while we are at it.
